{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The runtime containment checks out so far: `ensure-portable!` throws `ExceptionInfo`, which is caught by the receiver’s `Exception` catch before `map?` or request handling. I’m checking one potentially material migration detail now: the new regression test itself still requires the v1 codec, which may conflict with “off v1” and eventual deletion even though it is intentional as a hostile-payload producer."}}
